    "summary": "ac4-ac6 over the real threaded daemon in s4-acceptance.test.ts. ac5 uses 100 status calls (with short pauses so elapsedMs visibly grows) rather than s3's 200, and checks liveness through createIpcClient with the test daemon's socket. ac6 boots a second daemon with daemon.threads.enabled false and compares field names and value types of daemon.status and daemon.debug-status and the client entry's keys. Mutations (router not publishing busy, an extra status field) fail ac5 and ac6.",
